    {
      "name": "Primary Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Ink-filled main action; one per row or group.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-pri\">Match episodes</button>",
      "css": ":root{--ground:#E9EAEC;--sheet:#F7F7F8;--well:#FFFFFF;--ink:#17181A;--ink2:#53565C;--ink3:#7C8087;--rule:#C9CBCF;--rip:#2C4FA3;--rev:#C43D22;--enc:#E8B730;--fil:#1F7A74;--fail:#8E2A1B;--rev-ink:#B23A20;--fil-ink:#1B6B66;--thumb:#D6D8DC;--thumb-ink:#3E4146;--focus:#2C4FA3;--notice:#FBEDE9;--notice-line:#E6B3A6}.ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:var(--sheet);color:var(--ink);font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer}.ds-btn-pri{background:var(--ink);color:var(--sheet)}.ds-btn-pri:hover{opacity:.9}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Default Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-default",
      "description": "Sheet button with ink border.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn\">Choose edition</button>",
      "css": ":root{--ground:#E9EAEC;--sheet:#F7F7F8;--well:#FFFFFF;--ink:#17181A;--ink2:#53565C;--ink3:#7C8087;--rule:#C9CBCF;--rip:#2C4FA3;--rev:#C43D22;--enc:#E8B730;--fil:#1F7A74;--fail:#8E2A1B;--rev-ink:#B23A20;--fil-ink:#1B6B66;--thumb:#D6D8DC;--thumb-ink:#3E4146;--focus:#2C4FA3;--notice:#FBEDE9;--notice-line:#E6B3A6}.ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:var(--sheet);color:var(--ink);font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer}.ds-btn:hover{background:var(--well)}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Danger Button",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-danger",
      "description": "Destructive action, tomato border and ink-safe text.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-btn ds-btn-danger\">Discard rip</button>",
      "css": ":root{--ground:#E9EAEC;--sheet:#F7F7F8;--well:#FFFFFF;--ink:#17181A;--ink2:#53565C;--ink3:#7C8087;--rule:#C9CBCF;--rip:#2C4FA3;--rev:#C43D22;--enc:#E8B730;--fil:#1F7A74;--fail:#8E2A1B;--rev-ink:#B23A20;--fil-ink:#1B6B66;--thumb:#D6D8DC;--thumb-ink:#3E4146;--focus:#2C4FA3;--notice:#FBEDE9;--notice-line:#E6B3A6}.ds-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;padding:0 18px;border:1px solid var(--ink);background:var(--sheet);color:var(--ink);font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:14px;border-radius:3px;cursor:pointer}.ds-btn-danger{border-color:var(--rev);color:var(--rev-ink)}.ds-btn:hover{background:var(--well)}.ds-btn:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:2px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text Input",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Well-filled field with label and hint.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field\"><span class=\"ds-lbl\">Film title</span><input class=\"ds-input\" placeholder=\"Search TMDB\"><span class=\"ds-hint\">Year helps.</span></label>",
      "css": ":root{--ground:#E9EAEC;--sheet:#F7F7F8;--well:#FFFFFF;--ink:#17181A;--ink2:#53565C;--ink3:#7C8087;--rule:#C9CBCF;--rip:#2C4FA3;--rev:#C43D22;--enc:#E8B730;--fil:#1F7A74;--fail:#8E2A1B;--rev-ink:#B23A20;--fil-ink:#1B6B66;--thumb:#D6D8DC;--thumb-ink:#3E4146;--focus:#2C4FA3;--notice:#FBEDE9;--notice-line:#E6B3A6}.ds-field{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-lbl{font-weight:600;font-size:14px;color:var(--ink)}.ds-hint{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2)}.ds-input{min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--rule);background:var(--well);color:var(--ink);font:400 15px Archivo,sans-serif;border-radius:3px}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--ink3)}.ds-input:focus{border-color:var(--focus);outline:1px solid var(--focus)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Top Bar Nav",
      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Sheet bar, Narrow brand, underline active link, tomato Review count.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-top\"><span class=\"ds-brand\">Automatic Media Archive</span><a class=\"ds-nav\" aria-current=\"page\" href=\"#\">Now</a><a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"#\">Review<span class=\"ds-count\">3</span></a><a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"#\">Archive</a></nav>",
      "css": ":root{--ground:#E9EAEC;--sheet:#F7F7F8;--well:#FFFFFF;--ink:#17181A;--ink2:#53565C;--ink3:#7C8087;--rule:#C9CBCF;--rip:#2C4FA3;--rev:#C43D22;--enc:#E8B730;--fil:#1F7A74;--fail:#8E2A1B;--rev-ink:#B23A20;--fil-ink:#1B6B66;--thumb:#D6D8DC;--thumb-ink:#3E4146;--focus:#2C4FA3;--notice:#FBEDE9;--notice-line:#E6B3A6}.ds-top{display:flex;align-items:stretch;gap:4px;min-height:60px;padding:0 32px;background:var(--sheet);border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;}.ds-brand{align-self:center;margin-right:36px;font:700 19px/1 'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.02em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink)}.ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 16px;color:var(--ink2);text-decoration:none;font-weight:500;border-bottom:3px solid transparent}.ds-nav:hover{color:var(--ink)}.ds-nav[aria-current]{color:var(--ink);border-bottom-color:var(--ink)}.ds-count{margin-left:8px;background:var(--rev);color:#fff;font:700 12px/1 Archivo;padding:4px 7px;border-radius:3px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Divider Tab + Bin",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "tab-review",
      "description": "Signature: stage-coloured die-cut tab on a sheet with matching 3px top edge.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-bin\"><div class=\"ds-tab\">Needs Review <span>3</span></div><div class=\"ds-box\"><div class=\"ds-row\"><div class=\"ds-dtype\">DVD</div><div><div class=\"ds-tt\">The Office (UK) Series 1</div><div class=\"ds-ts\">which episode is which?</div></div></div></div></section>",
      "css": ":root{--ground:#E9EAEC;--sheet:#F7F7F8;--well:#FFFFFF;--ink:#17181A;--ink2:#53565C;--ink3:#7C8087;--rule:#C9CBCF;--rip:#2C4FA3;--rev:#C43D22;--enc:#E8B730;--fil:#1F7A74;--fail:#8E2A1B;--rev-ink:#B23A20;--fil-ink:#1B6B66;--thumb:#D6D8DC;--thumb-ink:#3E4146;--focus:#2C4FA3;--notice:#FBEDE9;--notice-line:#E6B3A6}.ds-bin{font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}.ds-tab{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;height:34px;padding:0 20px 0 14px;background:var(--rev);color:#fff;font:700 15px/1 'Archivo Narrow',sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;border-radius:6px 16px 0 0}.ds-tab span{font:700 13px Archivo;opacity:.9}.ds-box{background:var(--sheet);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-top:3px solid var(--rev)}.ds-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px 1fr;gap:16px;align-items:center;padding:16px 18px}.ds-dtype{width:56px;height:56px;background:var(--thumb);border:1px solid var(--rule);display:flex;align-items:flex-end;padding:5px;font:700 11px/1 Archivo;color:var(--thumb-ink);letter-spacing:.06em}.ds-tt{font-weight:600;font-size:16px}.ds-ts{color:var(--ink2);font-size:13px}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sticker",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "sticker-ripping",
      "description": "Signature: one price-gun status sticker per Disc.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-stk ds-rip\">Ripping</span> <span class=\"ds-stk ds-enc\">Waiting</span> <span class=\"ds-stk ds-fil\">Filed</span> <span class=\"ds-stk ds-fail\">Failed</span>",
      "css": ":root{--ground:#E9EAEC;--sheet:#F7F7F8;--well:#FFFFFF;--ink:#17181A;--ink2:#53565C;--ink3:#7C8087;--rule:#C9CBCF;--rip:#2C4FA3;--rev:#C43D22;--enc:#E8B730;--fil:#1F7A74;--fail:#8E2A1B;--rev-ink:#B23A20;--fil-ink:#1B6B66;--thumb:#D6D8DC;--thumb-ink:#3E4146;--focus:#2C4FA3;--notice:#FBEDE9;--notice-line:#E6B3A6}.ds-stk{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:26px;padding:0 11px 0 9px;border-radius:13px 4px 4px 13px;font:700 11px/1 Archivo,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#fff}.ds-stk::before{content:'';width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:currentColor;opacity:.9;margin-right:8px}.ds-rip{background:var(--rip)}.ds-enc{background:var(--enc);color:#17181A}.ds-fil{background:var(--fil)}.ds-fail{background:transparent;color:var(--fail);border:1px solid var(--fail)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Notice",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "notice",
      "description": "State as a mark: attention and ok variants.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-notice\"><svg class=\"ds-i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4\"/><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/></svg><div><b>Can't reach the NAS</b>Retrying every minute.</div></div><div class=\"ds-notice ds-ok\"><svg class=\"ds-i\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><div><b>Already filed.</b>Changes are optional.</div></div>",
      "css": ":root{--ground:#E9EAEC;--sheet:#F7F7F8;--well:#FFFFFF;--ink:#17181A;--ink2:#53565C;--ink3:#7C8087;--rule:#C9CBCF;--rip:#2C4FA3;--rev:#C43D22;--enc:#E8B730;--fil:#1F7A74;--fail:#8E2A1B;--rev-ink:#B23A20;--fil-ink:#1B6B66;--thumb:#D6D8DC;--thumb-ink:#3E4146;--focus:#2C4FA3;--notice:#FBEDE9;--notice-line:#E6B3A6}.ds-notice{display:grid;grid-template-columns:24px 1fr;gap:12px;padding:16px 18px;margin-bottom:12px;background:var(--notice);border:1px solid var(--notice-line);border-radius:3px;font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:15px;color:var(--ink)}.ds-notice b{display:block;margin-bottom:2px}.ds-i{width:18px;height:18px;margin-top:2px;fill:none;stroke:var(--rev-ink);stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.ds-ok{background:var(--sheet);border-color:var(--rule)}.ds-ok .ds-i{stroke:var(--fil-ink)}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Drive Panel",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Disc in the drive at largest scale with progress.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-drive\"><div class=\"ds-cell\">UHD BLU-RAY</div><div class=\"ds-body\"><div class=\"ds-title\">Blade Runner 2049</div><div class=\"ds-meta\">Title 3 of 7</div><div class=\"ds-prog\"><div class=\"ds-bar\"><i style=\"width:62%\"></i></div><div class=\"ds-pct\">62%</div></div></div></div>",
      "css": ":root{--ground:#E9EAEC;--sheet:#F7F7F8;--well:#FFFFFF;--ink:#17181A;--ink2:#53565C;--ink3:#7C8087;--rule:#C9CBCF;--rip:#2C4FA3;--rev:#C43D22;--enc:#E8B730;--fil:#1F7A74;--fail:#8E2A1B;--rev-ink:#B23A20;--fil-ink:#1B6B66;--thumb:#D6D8DC;--thumb-ink:#3E4146;--focus:#2C4FA3;--notice:#FBEDE9;--notice-line:#E6B3A6}.ds-drive{display:grid;grid-template-columns:168px 1fr;min-height:236px;background:var(--sheet);border:1px solid var(--rule);font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}.ds-cell{background:#24262A;color:#fff;padding:14px;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;font:700 11px/1.2 Archivo;letter-spacing:.08em}.ds-body{padding:22px 26px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.ds-title{font:800 38px/1.05 Archivo;letter-spacing:-.015em}.ds-meta{color:var(--ink2)}.ds-prog{margin-top:auto;display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:20px}.ds-bar{flex:1;height:12px;background:var(--well);border:1px solid var(--rule)}.ds-bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--rip)}.ds-pct{font:800 44px/1 Archivo;letter-spacing:-.02em;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Per-Job Settings Panel",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "A Job's settings as overrides of the globals: live controls that save on change, groups that lock at their Phase start.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-js\"><div class=\"ds-js-tab\">THIS JOB'S SETTINGS</div><div class=\"ds-js-box\"><div class=\"ds-js-grp\"><div class=\"ds-js-gh\"><b>Encode</b><span class=\"ds-js-saved\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg>Saved</span></div><div class=\"ds-js-fld\"><label>Quality</label><select class=\"ds-js-sel ov\"><option>CQ 20</option></select><span class=\"ds-js-note\">Default CQ 22 · <a href=\"#\">Reset</a></span><label>Encoder</label><select class=\"ds-js-sel\"><option>HEVC (NVIDIA)</option></select></div><p class=\"ds-js-until\">Can change until Encoding starts.</p></div><div class=\"ds-js-grp locked\"><div class=\"ds-js-gh\"><b>Rip</b><span class=\"ds-js-lk\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"/></svg>Locked at Ripping start</span></div><dl><dt>Skip Titles shorter than</dt><dd>30 seconds</dd></dl></div></div></div>",
      "css": ":root{--sheet:#F7F7F8;--well:#FFFFFF;--ink:#17181A;--ink2:#53565C;--rule:#C9CBCF;--fil-ink:#1B6B66}.ds-js{font-family:Archivo,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-js-tab{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;height:34px;padding:0 20px 0 14px;background:var(--ink);color:var(--sheet);font:700 15px/1 \"Archivo Narrow\",sans-serif;letter-spacing:.06em;border-radius:6px 16px 0 0}.ds-js-box{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;background:var(--sheet);border:1px solid var(--rule);border-top:3px solid var(--ink)}.ds-js-grp{padding:18px}.ds-js-grp+.ds-js-grp{border-left:1px solid var(--rule)}.ds-js-gh{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;margin-bottom:12px;font-size:15px}.ds-js-saved{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--fil-ink)}.ds-js-lk{display:inline-flex;gap:6px;align-items:center;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2)}.ds-js-fld{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 200px;gap:10px 12px;align-items:center;font-size:14px}.ds-js-fld label{color:var(--ink2)}.ds-js-sel{min-height:44px;padding:0 12px;border:1px solid var(--rule);background:var(--well);color:var(--ink);font:400 14px Archivo;border-radius:3px}.ds-js-sel.ov{border-color:var(--ink);font-weight:600}.ds-js-note{grid-column:2;margin-top:-6px;font-size:12px;color:var(--ink2)}.ds-js-note a{color:var(--ink)}.ds-js-until{margin-top:12px;font-size:13px;color:var(--ink2)}.locked b,.locked dt,.locked dd{color:var(--ink2);font-weight:400}.locked b{font-weight:700}.ds-js dl{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:8px 12px;font-size:14px;margin:0}.ds-js dd{margin:0}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "The Browser Bin",
    "overview": "The pipeline is a record-shop browser bin. Every Disc stands behind the divider of the stage it is in, and its status is the one price-gun sticker on its corner. Stages are bins, not cards: a coloured die-cut tab sits on top of a near-white sheet whose top edge picks up the tab's colour. A Disc that changes stage moves behind the next divider.\n\nThe world is cool grey and printed, not glossy. A grey bin ground, near-white sheets, near-black ink in three values, one 1px hairline rule weight, and four divider colours that each own one stage. Depth comes from the tab-on-sheet stack and the hairline grid, never from shadows. Size ranks urgency: the Disc in the drive is the largest thing on the page, and the bins beside it are small.\n\nThe interface is an Operate surface used on a phone at the drive and on a desktop for Review. Density is moderate, with 44px minimum targets throughout. It refuses the default sidebar, equal cards and status-badge table.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Four stage colours, each owning one stage: Ripping cobalt, Needs Review tomato, Encoding mustard, Filed teal.",
      "Die-cut divider tabs with an asymmetric cut (6px lead corner, 16px trailing corner).",
      "One sticker per Disc, pill-left / square-right, with a dot.",
      "One rule weight (1px `rule`), except a 3px stage-coloured top edge on bin sheets.",
      "Three ink values (`ink`, `ink-2`, `ink-3`) and tabular numerals everywhere.",
      "Flat surfaces; state shown as a mark (sticker, notice, tab colour), never a toast."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The One Stage, One Colour Rule",
        "body": "Cobalt, tomato, mustard and teal each mean one pipeline stage. Never use them for decoration, links or generic emphasis. The primary button is `ink`, not a stage colour.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Ink-On-Sheet Rule",
        "body": "When a stage colour is text or an icon on a sheet, use its `-ink` token. The raw stage colour is only for fills (tabs, stickers, bars, top edges).",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Both-Themes Rule",
        "body": "Every new token gets a light value, a `prefers-color-scheme: dark` value guarded by `:root:not([data-theme=\"light\"])`, and a matching `:root[data-theme=\"dark\"]` value.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Narrow Is For Dividers Rule",
        "body": "Archivo Narrow appears only on divider tabs and the brand. Headings and body stay in Archivo.",
        "section": "typography"
      },
      {
        "name": "The One Rule Weight Rule",
        "body": "Every border and divider is 1px `rule`. The only exceptions are the 3px stage top edge on bin sheets, the 3px active-nav underline, and the 2px focus ring.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** put every Disc in the bin for its current stage, with exactly one sticker.",
      "**Do** use stage colours only for their stage, and use the `-ink` tokens when they are text on a sheet.",
      "**Do** keep every control at least 44px tall, and nav targets at 48px on phones.",
      "**Do** define every new token for light, system-dark and forced-dark themes.",
      "**Do** let size rank urgency: the drive is the largest thing, then Needs Review, then the small bins.",
      "**Do** self-host Archivo and Archivo Narrow (400–800, Narrow 600–700) in production. The mockups load them from Google Fonts only for convenience."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** add drop shadows or raised cards. Depth comes from tabs, top edges and hairlines.",
      "**Don't** use toasts for state. Use a notice, a sticker or a change of bin.",
      "**Don't** build the default sidebar, equal card grid or status-badge table.",
      "**Don't** introduce a second rule weight beyond the documented exceptions.",
      "**Don't** put white text on Encoding mustard."
    ]
  }
}